OL,3,GNEWSAOffenders 'will face justice'
OL,4,Awarning as firework control zones
OL,5,Areturn
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland has warned those
OL,8,Finvolved in disorder around Halloween
OL,9,Fand Bonfire Night will face "very real
OL,10,Fconsequences".
OL,12,FFireworks Control Zones (FCZs) banning
OL,13,Fthe use of pyrotechnics in certain
OL,14,Fareas are scheduled to come into force
OL,15,Fin Edinburgh and Glasgow from 30
OL,16,FOctober in a bid to contain outbreaks
OL,17,Fof anti-social behaviour and violence.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
