OL,3,GNEWSAOffenders 'will face justice'
OL,4,Awarning as firework control zones
OL,5,Areturn
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficers said that last year there had
OL,8,Fbeen a "reduction" in instances of
OL,9,Fdisorder compared to previous years,
OL,10,Fwhen emergency crews were pelted with
OL,11,Fpetrol bombs and missiles.
OL,13,FBut they said they would not be
OL,14,Fcomplacent and those found to be
OL,15,Finvolved in "unacceptable criminality"
OL,16,Fwould be brought to justice.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
